{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06486","headline":"登天竺寺 · 綦毋潜","name":"登天竺寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡有化城最，西穷叠嶂深。\n松门当涧口，石路在峰心。\n幽见夕阳霁，高逢暮雨阴。\n佛身瞻绀发，宝地践黄金。\n云向竹谿尽，月从花洞临。\n因物成真悟，遗世在兹岑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"綦毋潜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}